# Files the CalibrationCity sample .blend needs beside it.
#
# A movie clip cannot be packed into a .blend, so the scene's footage has
# to arrive as real files in the same folder, where its relative paths
# (//CalibrationImage.jpg) find it. CamMatch reads this list when it
# downloads the sample, so footage can be renamed or added to here without
# every installed copy of the add-on needing an update to learn the names.
#
# One plain filename per line. Anything with a path separator in it is
# ignored, because this decides what gets written into a folder on
# somebody else's machine.
CalibrationImage.jpg
DistortedImage.jpg
